repository-code: "https://github.com/ssowers2/capstone-nlp-mental-health"
url: "https://github.com/ssowers2/capstone-nlp-mental-health"
license: MIT

abstract: |
  This capstone project for the Master of Science in Data Analytics
  at Northwest Missouri State University applies natural language
  processing and supervised machine learning techniques to classify
  mental health-related social media posts into the categories
  Neutral, Depression, and Suicidal Tendencies. The project
  demonstrates an end-to-end machine learning workflow including
  data validation, text preprocessing, feature engineering,
  predictive modeling, and interpretation of results.

